Subject: [PATCH] drm/gud: keep the default optimization level for EDID code

Clang's -O3 build trips the fortified read check in gud_connector.o.
Keep Kbuild's optimization level for that translation unit so the
rest of the kernel can build with -O3.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/gud/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/gud/Makefile
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/gud/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/gud/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+
+CFLAGS_REMOVE_gud_connector.o += -O3
 
 gud-y				:= gud_drv.o gud_pipe.o gud_connector.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_GUD)		+= gud.o
